 R←Test_SendEmail_42(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log;text
⍝ An address without a dot in the domain, like kai@localhost
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 parms.To←'kai@localhost'
 (rc msg log text)←∆Send parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'RCPT TO: <kai@localhost>')∊∆SERVER.Commands

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
